37,2,1,talk,Servas,,Eleven callouts last year. The room is a magnet for problems. We need to know why.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The invoices show 68,000 yen paid out. We are paying for a room that fails us.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The only unplanned talk is by the printer. We are isolated. We need a space for connection.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, if the wall is that thin, a quiet room is impossible. We need a meeting space.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
