46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,The crumbs are a sign of mess. A quiet room needs to be clean.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,The callouts suggest the equipment is failing. A kitchen will need more maintenance.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"The kitchen quote is cheaper, but the maintenance will be higher.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,The last awkward conversation was across the desks. We need a private space to talk.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,I think a meeting space is the best option. It solves the usage problem.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I prefer a quiet room. I need to rest.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,I am leaning towards a meeting space. It is more efficient.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I am worried about the cost. But a meeting space seems practical.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I want a space where we can talk without being overheard. A meeting space works.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
